cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below and the original valiDrops paper."
title: "validrops: automated quality control of droplet-based single-cell and single-nucleus RNA-seq data"
abstract: >-
  Python/scanpy port of the R package valiDrops. Ranks barcodes, filters on
  quality-metric and expression-based cluster-metric thresholds, and optionally
  labels dead cells, annotating an AnnData object in place.
